<div class="card">
  <div class="card-head"><div><h3>Tambah Akun GTK</h3><p>Akun langsung aktif dan dapat digunakan untuk masuk</p></div></div>
  <form method="post" action="/sim-gtk/manajemen/gtk/baru">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <div class="form-grid cols-3">
      <div class="field"><label>Nama Lengkap</label><input name="nama" type="text" placeholder="Nama dengan gelar" required></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Email</label><input name="email" type="email" placeholder="nama@madrasah.sch.id" required></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Kata Sandi Awal</label><input name="password" type="text" placeholder="minimal 6 karakter" required></div>
      <div class="field"><label>NUPTK</label><input name="nuptk" type="text" placeholder="16 digit"></div>
      <div class="field"><label>NIP</label><input name="nip" type="text" placeholder="NIP / NIK"></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Mata Pelajaran / Tugas</label><input name="mapel" type="text" placeholder="Fikih / Guru Kelas"></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Peran</label><select name="role"><option value="guru">Guru / GTK</option><option value="admin">Admin Madrasah</option></select></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit"><svg class="ic ic-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"></use></svg> Tambah Akun GTK</button></div>
  </form>
</div>
    
    <div class="tiny muted mt-4" style="padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
      SIM-GTK &mdash; Sistem Informasi Manajemen Guru dan Tenaga Kependidikan Madrasah. Semua data ditampilkan sesuai madrasah dan hak akses akun Anda.
    </div>
  </main>
